graph TD
    A[HTTP Request: POST /api/books] --> B[Spring Controller: BookController]
    B --> C[Validate BookRequestDTO]
    C --> D[BookServiceImpl]
    D --> E[map DTO to BookEntity via BookMapper]
    E --> F[Persist to DB via BookRepository]
    F --> G[Return BookEntity]
    G --> H[Map BookEntity to BookResponseDTO via BookMapper]
    H --> I[Return HTTP 201 Response]

%% Parallel processes
    B --> J[SecurityContext: Extract JWT + Validate ROLE]
    D --> K[AOP Logging: log method + time]
    D --> L[Exception Handling: BookNotFoundException, etc.]

    style J fill:#d44b,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:2px
    style K fill:#d44b,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
    style L fill:#d44b,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:2px
